mutable struct Point
    number x
    number y
end struct

struct Holder
    Point point
end struct

type MaybePoint is optional Point

function echo_maybe takes MaybePoint mp returns MaybePoint is
    return mp
end function

function bump takes Point pt is
    add 1 to x of pt
end function

constant p is make Point with x 1, y 2
say p
change x of p to 5
add 3 to x of p
subtract 2 from y of p
multiply x of p by 2
divide x of p by 4
say p
constant alias is p
bump alias
say p
constant q is p with y 99
say p is q
say q
constant holder is make Holder with point p
constant held is point of holder
change y of held to 42
say p
constant maybe is the result of echo_maybe p
say maybe is p
constant uniq is unique list of p, p, q
say length of uniq
constant points is list of p, q
constant qp is item 2 of points
change x of qp to 7
say q
constant byName is dictionary "home" to p
constant home is value of "home" in byName
change x of home to 11
say p
